alinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4091486482","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4091486482"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-10T17:45:13Z","commit_id":"87c03fc97f8754b02e8ee7a2f605fab791283123"},{"id":4091736470,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7z4vGW","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\n\n**Testing project:** [test_ssao_multibounce.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26637354/test_ssao_multibounce.zip)\n\n*For benchmarking:* [test_ssao_multibounce.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26637612/test_ssao_multibounce.zip)\n\n## Preview\n\n*The default SSAO intensity is `2.0`. By increasing it to a value around `3.0`, you can get a more similar result to multi-bounce disabled on brighter materials, but this will make it stronger than before on darker materials.*\n\nNo multi-bounce | With multi-bounce | With multi-bounce + intensity 3.0\n-|-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e48c2f5f-2e61-4770-aaba-52ced037e736\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6593c91c-7d8c-47bf-bdaf-0c987e5f0f23\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6be26951-0f47-4ec8-8089-6ee9274ad286\" />\n\nNo multi-bounce | With multi-bounce | With multi-bounce + intensity 3.0\n-|-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/72d7edf2-441d-4a2f-a0b2-cf42d620a621\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/25182211-8df2-4124-a1f7-84d4efe2976c\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef0f8f31-79fb-4442-beb3-673f0e42f01f\" />\n\nNo multi-bounce | With multi-bounce | With multi-bounce + intensity 3.0\n-|-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/319694d7-a75e-4890-b255-840794289359\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e7e176a3-1c2b-4541-bc73-1ecb8fbc682c\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a7c2ee2-5e1d-4d76-9a43-eafc4faf193d\" />\n\n## Benchmark\n\nUsing the second testing project linked above, run with a release export template (`production=yes lto=full`). All the viewport's pixels are covered by opaque geometry and other rendering features are turned down to the minimum, so that we can measure and isolate material shading cost as much as possible.\n\nDifferences might be subtle, but all scenarios are GPU-limited, and I've made sure the difference is reproducible across multiple runs.\n\n<details open>\n\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\n\n- **CPU:** AMD Ryzen 9 9950X3D\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-6000 CL30)\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 43)\n</details>\n\n### 3840×2160 fullscreen\n\nBefore | After\n-|-\n2186 FPS (0.46 mspf) | 2166 FPS (0.46 mspf)\n\n### 7680×4320 fullscreen\n\nBefore | After\n-|-\n769 FPS (1.30 mspf) | 760 FPS (1.32 mspf)","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4091736470","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4091736470"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-10T18:31:56Z","commit_id":"87c03fc97f8754b02e8ee7a2f605fab791283123"},{"id":4100704841,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc70a8pJ","user":{"login":"blueskythlikesclouds","id":19259897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MjU5ODk3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19259897?u=6ecace2ddb6505607f21e3c41da42157298bd406&v=4","gravatar_id":"","u