://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Reviewed again in a rendering meeting. This looks great! \n\nOverall two things need to happen before merging. \n1. As Bastiaan pointed out, the project setting needs to be set to false be default, but can be set to true for new projects. See how Jolt and D3D12 are handled to understand how to make that happen. Since this is a big visual change it has to be opt-in for existing projects\n2. Remove the render_mode entirely. We are not convinced it is needed. This is a case of future-proofing for something speculative. Instead, let's go ahead with the project setting only, and then wait and see if any users request to be able to disable it per material. ","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4374742174","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115426#pullrequestreview-4374742174"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115426"}},"submitted_at":"2026-05-27T17:52:12Z","commit_id":"8f8d33d7c9b3bce9da2ed792e7208d747e77b51a"},{"id":4377193043,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBOaqUw","user":{"login":"KenzieMac130","id":7585719,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODU3MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7585719?u=4a3628ad6d02b550753f186137601d56a8ef66e6&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130","html_url":"https://github.com/KenzieMac130","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KenzieMac130/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/K